# The framework's runtime dependencies (open-coder-ai/chock pyproject.toml at .framework-ref) and its
# build backend, installed by hash; CI then builds the framework checkout with --no-deps --no-build-isolation
# and `pip check` fails the job when a framework bump adds or changes a dependency this file lacks.
